   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppnbppp/2n5/1B1pP3/3p4/5N2/PPP2PPP/RNBQ1RK1 w kq - 4 8",
   "line": [
    "Be7"
   ],
   "spoken": "Don't waste a tempo shooing the bishop — it's likely to capture of its own accord anyway. Develop the bishop to e7, deliberately keeping the c-square free so the pawn can later expand there once the exchanges happen.",
   "kind": "plan"
