    "O-O"
   ],
   "spoken": "Note that capturing the advanced pawn fails, because a recapture leaves you pinned. The right way to break the pin isn't the reflexive rook-pawn move but castling — an unpin that also completes development. Solve two problems with one move.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
