   "line": [
    "Re1"
   ],
   "spoken": "The most oppressive feature of the position is the advanced enemy pawn hanging over everything, cutting the arteries and denying the pieces access to the sixth rank. So the idea is to challenge it directly with f6 and try to remove it at all costs. A knight retreat to reinforce the queenside is the quieter alternative.",
